  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: kam193 (c7d24a42d93443e6dd0a5c3899e31e60624c1564a215ad84be99be1e811205ca)\nThe package ships a malicious executable started during the building of a wheel/installation. It has been identified as Overlord RAT.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-filipt\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - malware\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n\n - rat\n",
